<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Electric - 96/97 group results.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Electric - 96/97 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.73 trln	 vs	    3.51 trln</p>
<p> Operating	   51.56		vs	  176.54</p>
<p> Pretax		67.90		vs	  128.49</p>
<p> Net		    8.52		vs	   59.21</p>
<p> EPS		    3.97 yen	  vs	   25.59 yen</p>
<p> Diluted EPS	  3.97 yen	  vs	   25.59 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsubishi Electric Corp is a comprehensive electric machinery maker. (Figures are reported based on U.S. accounting rules.)</p>
